{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676720/extras/a8ab1005a8aee242c86750178ba3eb38.avif?t=1726928623\" width=600 height=201 /></span><br>Bug Killers \u2013 is a dynamic Top Down shooter where you will need to turn crowds of bugs-mutants into meat. The game has three modes: Survival, PvP and PvE. Different types of armament will help you to effectively destroy the enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676720/extras/2b0483ab0298616e30757d4e767b9b3d.avif?t=1726928623\" width=600 height=162 /></span><br><br>Increase the level of your character and get new ranks. Compete with other players in the tables of leaderboard. Accomplish the tasks and get the achievements.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676720/extras/2e8f2b3d94a03f695b447c32c4328e94.avif?t=1726928623\" width=600 height=69 /></span><br><br>In the survival mode you need to survive maximum number of waves. Each wave will be stronger and replenished with more powerful types of bugs. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676720/extras/31ec29325949a9c094a9778199331166.avif?t=1726928623\" width=600 height=223 /></span><br>For the effective repulse of the enemies waves, you have in your arsenal additional armament: Turrets, Mines, Grenades. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676720/extras/fbf0ce4ac6d743b06fb4fe80568d7a77.avif?t=1726928623\" width=600 height=69 /></span><br><br>PvE mode\u2013 fights with other players against bugs-mutants. Bugs spawn endlessly. Outcome of the struggle depends on your skills and equipment. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676720/extras/adf102770dac8fef01d26fb6c51c9a36.avif?t=1726928623\" width=600 height=178 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676720/extras/b58cab256315c14444647cb6b3c419b3.avif?t=1726928623\" width=600 height=69 /></span><br><br>In PvP mode players play against each other. Upgrade your character and use location for your own benefit. Time is running out, only one will win. Don't miss your chance to be the best! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676720/extras/926590c86f9587594ba0b295090bced5.avif?t=1726928623\" width=600 height=202 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"40824de15c7321ff0f317ba0be2d40c5111845de.jpg","localized_name":"5 Waves","name":"5 Waves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/676720/40824de15c7321ff0f317ba0be2d40c5111845de.jpg"},{"icon":"7de6b11d95f12d57382c926fec6ee94beb4a49d5.jpg","localized_name":"10 Waves","name":"10 Waves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/676720/7de6b11d95f12d57382c926fec6ee94beb4a49d5.jpg"},{"icon":"22d2385463b3dd3e5f98248b26d377bf6826e445.jpg","localized_name":"15 Waves","name":"15 Waves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/676720/22d2385463b3dd3e5f98248b26d377bf6826e445.jpg"},{"icon":"1841b30d4483d1ee9b9707e2b60ca2c279e033bc.jpg","localized_name":"20 Waves","name":"20 Waves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/676720/1841b30d4483d1ee9b9707e2b60ca2c279e033bc.jpg"},{"icon":"00c506625537e7541e04a470e571138342a203aa.jpg","localized_name":"25 Waves","name":"25 Waves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/676720/00c5